From 45033272fad79937abf2c86f0d8a74b1131221d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: greyoak111 <151205158+greyoak111@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:48:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 18/39] Add danmaku moderation, blocked words, Super Chat pin
 and gift filter

Right-clicking a chat line offers copy and mute (this stream, 1 hour,
permanently) via AddSilentUser, with the parameters the live room page
sends. The room tab manages Bilibili's room-wide blocked words
(Get/Add/DelShieldKeyword); the list parser tolerates payload shape
changes. The danmaku tab pins the latest Super Chat for its paid
duration and can show gifts and Super Chats only; the choice is saved.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
